# GENERATION PIPELINE

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Generation Pipeline defines how CAS transforms athlete information into a complete training session.

It does not describe individual decision engines.

It defines the order in which they collaborate.

The pipeline is the reasoning workflow of the Combat Athlete System.

---

# Mission

Transform:

Athlete

↓

Knowledge

↓

Current Context

↓

Scientific Principles

↓

Training Session

Every recommendation produced by CAS follows this same process.

---

# Core Principle

Every decision depends on previous decisions.

The order matters.

Changing the sequence changes the final recommendation.

The pipeline therefore remains deterministic.

---

# Philosophy

CAS does not generate exercises first.

CAS first determines:

What should be achieved.

Only then does it decide:

How to achieve it.

Objectives always precede implementation.

---

